  "notes": "{年中|ねんじゅう} can mean \"all year\" or \"always\" depending on context.\n\nALL YEAR ROUND:\n- {年中|ねんじゅう}{無休|むきゅう} (open 365 days a year)\n- {年中|ねんじゅう}{行事|ぎょうじ} (annual events/traditions)\n- {年中|ねんじゅう}{温暖|おんだん} (warm year-round)\n\nALWAYS/CONSTANTLY:\n- {年中|ねんじゅう}〜ている (is always ~ing)\n- Often implies exasperation or criticism\n- Similar to いつも but more emphatic\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {一年中|いちねんじゅう} - throughout the year (more precise)\n- {終年|しゅうねん} - all year (formal)\n- いつも - always (neutral)\n- しょっちゅう - constantly (colloquial)\n\nNote: The reading ねんちゅう is also used but ねんじゅう is more common.",
